   "texto": [
    "**Gider** = feel like: **Jeg gider ikke gå ud.** = I don't feel like going out.",
    "**Orker** = have strength or hold on: **Jeg orker ikke mere.** = I can't take it anymore.",
    "**Behøver** = need; with **ikke** = no need: **Du behøver ikke komme.** = No need for you to come."
